            "review_title": "Review at Blue Gecko Bar",
            "review_text": "Danny\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nBest pub in town with country vibe!\nMar 2020\nFirst time visited and quite satisfied. Not a fancy place so don't expect much. Drinks are fine, a variety of beers and liquid with affordable price. The atmosphere is great, suitable for gently chilling. Music is fine, not too loud so easy to have conversations. They had billiard competition while I visited, looked fun, also had dartboard challenge and acoustic music coming soon - introduced by miss lovely boss. The main vibe is Aussie, kinda like sport bar. More fun if going with group. Highly recommended!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 19, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
