            "review_title": "Review at Blue Gecko Bar",
            "review_text": "Tam Ng\nCa Mau, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nHappy wine and time\nFeb 2020 • Friends\nLast month, I gathered my friend to celebrate my birthday at Blue Gecko. And I met a group of Melbourne and a group of Sydney, I relized Blue Gecko just only for Melbourne or related Merbourne style. For sure! I won’t explain this but if you want to find out, why don’t visit here? \nAbout my birthday, food and drink are very reasonable, Ms. Lien (I think she is Manager or Owner - I will ask her next time) supported us a lot to let me have a great birthday even I didn’t book yet. \nI will comeback to enjoy soon\nRead more\nWritten March 18, 2020",
