            "review_text": "Ivan 4AM\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam23 contributions\n0\nI do love this place by my thought\nMar 2020 • Friends\nI had read a lot good and bad reviews before decided to visit here, and I do know why the old guests wrote bad reviews. To me, I do love this place by their decoration and drink most. This place brought me back to 90s and different decoration from the others. And the drink is pretty good with price 2$/bottle of beer as well as the music not too loud, enough to talk and listen. Staffs didn’t serve me a lot so it didn’t make annoy to me, that’s why I felt good.\nRead more\nWritten March 11, 2020",
