            "review_title": "Review at Blue Gecko Bar",
            "review_text": "Glenn K\nVermont, Australia300 contributions\n0\nCosy for footy\nJun 2019 • Friends\nEnjoyed watching Adelaide and Geelong tough it out on a Friday night. Atmosphere cosy and very sports orientated Aussie bar. Plenty of memorabilia and Aussie slang and feeling. Staff very attentive, courteous and quick to replenish your beer etc. we had some bar snacks, mini dim sum, spring rolls and fries which helped the beers go down really well. Not a hard place to find if you know your way around the city. Probably best to grab a local taxi and not negotiate the local traffic. We had an enjoyable evening and met a lot of Aussie doing the same.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 29, 2019",
