            "review_title": "Review at Blue Gecko Bar",
            "review_text": "KiwiBobCambodia\nPort Moresby, Papua New Guinea101 contributions\n1\nA few beers and a feed\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nWe first went to the Blue Gecko ANZAC day 1999 with our ten week old son. Had a great night with Oz sailors in town for the event.\nOur son turned 20 in Tet so we're back for about the tenth time. Beer cold and cheap. Kim got outside pork and rice while I braved a somewhat dubious hamburger.\nPlenty of cricket to watch we were well. Looked after. Still our favourite drop in bar.\nDon't worry about the haters. If job one is a cold beer, you're good to go\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 14, 2019",
