            "review_text": "navynip\nNew York City, New York7 contributions\n0\nGREAT BAR, GREAT HOST, GREAT HOSTESSES, ALWAYS WILL RETURN\nOct 2018 • Friends\n3 New Yorkers met up in Ho Chi Min City for a tour. One was there in 68 with the Army and wanted to return. The other was a commercial pilot whose father and father in law were there and then me, 21 year Navy Officer. The city and people were warm and friendly. The Blue Geckos owner and wife took great care of us each night. We used it as our base to plan the next day, play pool, eat and relax. Dont is believe bad reviews, go and see for yourself. Van will greet you like family but might beat you in pool.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 6, 2018",
